# Smaug System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    P[Player] --> I[Input]
    O[Overtine] --> I
    I --> C[Companion AI]
    C --> E[Emerald]
    C --> W[Wanderer]
    I --> G[Castle / INCLARE]
    E --> G
    W --> G
    G --> S[Smite: Before / During / After]
    S --> R[Evidence Record]
    R --> T[System Inspection Store]
    D[Dream] --> READY[Ready]
    OS[Operating System] --> T
    F[Firecaster Simulation] --> G
```

The diagram is a conceptual architecture map. Arrows represent data/control
flow, not unrestricted authority. Castle/INCLARE remains the authorization
boundary and evidence is retained for inspection.
